    {
      "statement": "For the 6.2L engine with inadequate oil pressure at idle, the PMCS action is to replace the engine oil and filter regardless of whether the oil is contaminated, then verify oil pressure with the engine running.",
      "answer_quote": "the PMCS action for inadequate oil pressure—regardless of contamination—is to **replace the engine oil and filter** and verify oil pressure with the engine running"
